 {id:'T04',phase:2,field:'coverage.requestedStart',question:'When do you need Medicare coverage to start?',why:'The timing helps organize what to check next. Your requested month does not establish eligibility or an enrollment deadline.',teach:'Part A helps cover inpatient hospital care. Part B helps cover doctors’ services and outpatient care. You can receive these benefits through Original Medicare or Medicare Advantage (Part C). Your requested start is not verified eligibility or enrollment.',options:[['month','Choose a start month'],['already','Already on Medicare'],['unknown','Not sure']],writes:['coverage.requestedStart','coverage.requestedStartMonth']},
